A detailed Piet Mondrian style geometric composition featuring interconnected rectangular sections in primary colors (red, yellow, blue) with bold black grid lines, where some rectangles contain smaller nested grids suggesting layers of access and hierarchy, with certain sections appearing to open or extend into adjacent areas through subtle gradient transitions, creating a visual metaphor of structured data compartments with controlled pathways between them, the composition balanced asymmetrically with larger blocks at the base suggesting organizational foundation, smaller subdivisions rising upward representing refined access levels, clean sharp edges throughout, white spaces providing breathing room between colored sections, the overall effect conveying systematic organization and deliberate architectural control of space and connection.
